flowchart TD
  U[Author - Authenticated User] --> C1[Open Conference CFP Page]
  C1 --> G1{Submissions Visibility}

  G1 -->|Public| W1[Start Submission Wizard]
  G1 -->|Invite-only| I1[Enter Invite Code]
  I1 -->|Valid| W1
  I1 -->|Invalid| I2[Show Error / Retry]
  G1 -->|Private| X1[Show Not Available]

  W1 --> S1[Step 1: Submission Details\nTitle, Abstract, Keywords]
  S1 --> S2[Step 2: Category + Presentation Type]
  S2 --> S3[Step 3: Authors\nAdd/Order/Presenter Flag]
  S3 --> S4[Step 4: Uploads - optional or required\nAbstract File / Full-text File]
  S4 --> RV[Review & Submit]
  RV --> ST[Status: Submitted]

  ST --> TR[Track Status in Account]
  TR -->|Revision Requested| RR[View Feedback]
  RR --> ED[Edit Submission]
  ED --> RS[Resubmit]
  RS --> ST
